# Jarvis reads NO environment variables for secrets: keys live in config.json (git-ignored; start
# from config.example.json) and the Google token in secrets/ (encrypted with Windows DPAPI).
# This file lists the variable names that matter, so you know what to leave alone. Never commit a .env.
#
# Must stay UNSET: Jarvis runs Claude through your Claude Code subscription, and preflight.py warns
# if either is set (it would switch Claude Code to pay-per-use API billing).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
